Follow AGENTS.md. Do not fabricate metrics or scientific wins.
Keep software readiness separate from research outcomes.
Protect legacy research repos; no destructive cleanup or remote push/deploy.
One numerical worker by default; CPU first; explicit budgets.
Unimplemented capabilities must return unsupported/not-run, never mock research success.
Use tasks/tasks.json as the dependency source of truth.
